E
old sign decayed~
ATTENTION:
The lands beyond this point are lawless. There are no regular Imperial patrols
to protect you if you should venture beyond this warning. Bandits, barbarians,
deep-spawn and more live in the dark mountain. You would do well to leave.
Those that cross and return may be held for questioning.


Your Death is Your Own.
  The Captain Commander of Sorrow's Post.
~
